        "node::W3188477177"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stoichiometric L12 ordering generates high antiphase-boundary energy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::W3188477177"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chemical ordering increases resistance to screw-dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::W3188477177"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "High antiphase-boundary energy inhibits cross-slip of screw dislocations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cross-slip inhibition forces deformation to occur by planar slip.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Jagged B2/FCC interfaces act as strong obstacles and concentrate stress at boundary serrations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The combination of planar slip and stress concentration at jagged boundaries causes interfacial decohesion and brittle fracture.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aging near 750°C reduces chemical order and antiphase-boundary energy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aging near 750°C smoothens B2/FCC interfaces, restores cross-slip, and restores ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy undergoes a non-monotonic ductile-brittle-ductile transition, with minimum elongation near 600°C and recovery near 750°C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
